#BlueLink6 I/O Channels: Ports` ` , vs_dyn Ports` , vs_dyn Ports`

#MiscYellow1
! Include folder containing supporting .m files for Simulink EV battery model
*cpar_include Extensions\Simulink\ev_battery
#ENDMYellow

LIVE_SERVER_UPDATE_FREQ_MAX 60

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This "Models: Simulink" dataset links to a Simulink model of an electric battery, which replaces an existing internal battery model of electrified powertrain system of CarSim.
#
